self_ref":"#/texts/3","text":"Below are the important timelines that must be adhered to."},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"If payment has not been made by the due date, you and your sponsor will be notified by email that payment has not been received . Following which your student account will be placed on hold and access to administrative services will be suspended and future term registration will not be permitted until the overdue balance has been paid in full.","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":424.0,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":88.0,"r":523.6666666666666,"t":486.6666666666667},"charspan":[0,345],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/4","text":"If payment has not been made by the due date, you and your sponsor will be notified by email that payment has not been received . Following which your student account will be placed on hold and access to administrative services will be suspended and future term registration will not be permitted until the overdue balance has been paid in full."},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"section_header","level":1,"orig":"6. Penalties","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":400.3333333333333,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":89.0,"r":157.66666666666666,"t":414.6666666666667},"charspan":[0,12],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/5","text":"6. Penalties"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"Sponsorship application received after the deadline of 9th January 2018, will result in an assessment of $50 late payment penalty to your Student account and further $40 late fee will be applied at the end of revision period if the Sponsorship application is not received.","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":340.0,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":88.0,"r":522.6666666666666,"t":391.3333333333333},"charspan":[0,272],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/6","text":"Sponsorship application received after the deadline of 9th January 2018, will result in an assessment of $50 late payment penalty to your Student account and further $40 late fee will be applied at the end of revision period if the Sponsorship application is not received."},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"Once the invoice is 30 days or more past due, the University reserves the right to deny any further credit to the sponsor, and overdue student account may be subject to regular collection processes.","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":290.0,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":88.33333333333333,"r":519.0,"t":329.0},"charspan":[0,198],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/7","text":"Once the invoice is 30 days or more past due, the University reserves the right to deny any further credit to the sponsor, and overdue student account may be subject to regular collection processes."},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"hope this information is helpful, and if you require further information, please do not hesitate to contact me at the number below.","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":251.0,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":88.0,"r":492.0,"t":281.6666666666667},"charspan":[0,131],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/8","text":"hope this information is helpful, and if you require further information, please do not hesitate to contact me at the number below."},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"Sincerely ,","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":212.0,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":88.33333333333333,"r":146.33333333333334,"t":228.0},"charspan":[0,11],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/9","text":"Sincerely ,"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"Abiola Idowu Receivables Analyst- (Sponsored Students) Abiola.idowu@umanitoba.ca 204-474-8718","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":147.0,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":88.66666666666667,"r":331.3333333333333,"t":199.66666666666663},"charspan":[0,93],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/10","te